# Copy to .env.production (or set in your host's dashboard) ONLY when the frontend is
# deployed on a different origin than the backend — e.g. frontend on Vercel/Netlify, backend
# on Railway. Leave unset for local dev (Vite's proxy handles /api, see vite.config.ts) and
# for a single-service deploy where the backend itself serves this build's dist/.
#
# Public backend URL, no trailing slash and no /api suffix — the client appends /api itself.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.up.railway.app
